            "body": "> The existing `laravel_ls` configuration targets the unrelated `laravel-ls/laravel-ls` project, so users of the official server currently need to define a custom Neovim configuration.\r\n\r\nWell this is confusing. How are users supposed to know which one to choose?  They both look similar.\r\n\r\nIs `laravel-ls/laravel-ls` still relevant, what are the tradeoffs?",
